{"last_link_id": 26, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["\n## 工作原理（声音设计）\n\n该参数接受一个用逗号分隔的说话人属性字符串。每个属性属于一个类别（性别、年龄、音调、风格、口音或方言）。在同一类别中一次只能选择一个属性。不同类别的属性可以自由组合。instruct\n\n模型会自动检测 instruct 文本的语言并在内部进行标准化 —— 你可以使用英文、中文或中英混合书写\n\n## 支持的属性\n\n### 性别\n\n| English | Chinese |\n|---------|---------|\n| male | 男 |\n| female | 女 |\n\n### 年龄\n\n| English | Chinese |\n|---------|---------|\n| child | 儿童 |\n| teenager | 少年 |\n| young adult | 青年 |\n| middle-aged | 中年 |\n| elderly | 老年 |\n\n### 音调\n\n| English | Chinese |\n|---------|---------|\n| very low pitch | 极低音调 |\n| low pitch | 低音调 |\n| moderate pitch | 中音调 |\n| high pitch | 高音调 |\n| very high pitch | 极高音调 |\n\n### 风格\n\n| English | Chinese |\n|---------|---------|\n| whisper | 耳语 |\n\n### 英语口音（仅英文文本生效）\n\nOnly effective when the synthesis text is in English.\n\n| Accent |\n|--------|\n| american accent |\n| british accent |\n| australian accent |\n| canadian accent |\n| indian accent |\n| chinese accent |\n| korean accent |\n| japanese accent |\n| portuguese accent |\n| russian accent |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "-", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 1171.54296875], "pos": [-234.569580078125, 1149.479736328125], "id": 27, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["## 节点\n\n### OmniVoice 长文本 TTS\n\n支持长文本语音合成，带智能分段和可选的语音克隆。`ref_audio` 为可选 —— 不连接时将自动生成声音。\n\n### OmniVoice 语音克隆 TTS\n\n从参考音频中克隆声音。必须提供 `ref_audio`。不支持分段 —— 长文本请使用长文本 TTS。\n\n### OmniVoice 语音设计 TTS\n\n根据文本描述设计合成声音。无需参考音频。\n\n### OmniVoice 多说话人 TTS\n\n使用 `[Speaker_N]:` 标签生成多角色对话。在 ComfyUI >= 0.8.1 中支持动态说话人输入。\n\n\n---\n\n## 生成参数\n\n| 参数                   | 默认值  | 范围      | 描述                       |\n| -------------------- | ---- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| steps                | 32   | 4-64    | 扩散步数。16=更快，32=均衡，64=最佳质量 |\n| guidance_scale       | 2.0  | 0-10    | 无分类器引导。越高=越贴近文本          |\n| t_shift              | 0.1  | 0-1     | 时间步偏移。越小=更强调早期步骤         |\n| speed                | 1.0  | 0.5-2.0 | 语速。>1=更快，<1=更慢           |\n| duration             | 0.0  | 0-60    | 固定输出时长（秒）。会覆盖 speed。0=自动 |\n| position_temperature | 5.0  | 0-20    | 掩码位置随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机      |\n| class_temperature    | 0.0  | 0-5     | token 采样随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机  |\n| layer_penalty_factor | 5.0  | 0-20    | 对更深层 codebook 的惩罚        |\n| denoise              | True | —       | 添加去噪 token 以获得更干净的输出     |\n| preprocess_prompt    | True | —       | 清理参考音频（去除静音、添加标点）        |\n| postprocess_output   | True | —       | 去除生成音频中的长静音              |\n| keep_model_loaded    | True | —       | 保持模型加载（运行间隙卸载到 CPU）      |\n\n**仅限长文本 TTS：**\n\n| 参数              | 默认值 | 范围    | 描述                  |\n| --------------- | --- | ----- | ------------------- |\n| words_per_chunk | 100 | 0-500 | 每段词数。0=不分段。在句子边界处分割 |\n\n---\n\n### 非语言标签\n  直接在你的正文中插入这些内容：\n\n\n[laughter]\t自然的笑声\n[sigh]\t含蓄的叹息\n[sniff]\t嗅闻声\n[question-en], ,[question-ah][question-oh]\t疑问语调\n[surprise-ah], , ,[surprise-oh][surprise-wa][surprise-yo]\t惊讶表情\n[dissatisfaction-hnn]\t不满音\n[confirmation-en]\t确认的咕哝声\n\n示例：\n\n[laughter] You really got me! [sigh] I didn't see that coming at all.\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "-", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [590.7899780273438, 1046.4969482421875], "pos": [-884.8985595703125, 1147.5142822265625], "id": 22, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["\n### 中文方言（仅中文文本生效）\n\nOnly effective when the synthesis text is in Chinese.\n\n| Dialect |\n|---------|\n| 河南话 |\n| 陕西话 |\n| 四川话 |\n| 贵州话 |\n| 云南话 |\n| 桂林话 |\n| 济南话 |\n| 石家庄话 |\n| 甘肃话 |\n| 宁夏话 |\n| 青岛话 |\n| 东北话 |\n\n## Writing Instruct Strings\n\nSeparate attributes with commas (half-width `,` for English, full-width `，`\nfor Chinese — the model auto-fixes mismatches).\n\n```\n# English\n\"female, young adult, high pitch, british accent\"\n\n# Chinese\n\"女，青年，高音调，四川话\"\n\n# Mixed (auto-normalised)\n\"female, young adult, 四川话\"\n```\n\n### Tips\n\n- **Combine freely** across categories: `\"male, elderly, low pitch, whisper\"`.\n- **Leave it to the model**: omit attributes you don't care about — the model\n  fills in the rest. For example `\"female\"` alone is valid.\n- **Case-insensitive**: `\"Male\"`, `\"MALE\"`, and `\"male\"` are all accepted, the code will normalize them to lower case.\n\n- **Accent vs Dialect**: English accents are only applied to English speech, Chinese dialects are only applied to Chinese speech.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [223.74749755859375, 1137.75390625], "pos": [42.933616638183594, 1148.970458984375], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [18], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["OmniVoice 是一款最先进的大规模多语言零信号文本转语音（TTS）模型，支持600多种语言。它基于一种新颖的扩散语言模型式架构，能够生成高质量的语音，具有更优越的推断速度，支持语音克隆和语音设计"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [385.4545593261719, 105.45454406738281], "pos": [1547.7025146484375, 2193.528076171875], "id": 23, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [16], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["[Speaker_1]: OmniVoice 是一款最先进的大规模多语言零信号文本转语音（TTS）模型，支持600多种语言。\n[Speaker_2]: 它基于一种新颖的扩散语言模型式架构，能够生成高质量的语音，\n\n[Speaker_1]: 具有更优越的推断速度，支持语音克隆和语音设计！\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name